      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Keep fluid intake ↑enough for a urine output of ± 2 liters/day (helps ⍉xanthine stones; w uricosurics, helps prevent urate precipitation)."
     }
    ]
   }
